        "original_id": "6343e068-d9d6-57a2-9c76-7b77adb62008",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: \"All We Ever Knew\", \"Signs of Light\"\n- People: Charity Rose Thielen, Chris Zasche, Kenny Hensley, Tyler Williams\n- Organizations: The Head and the Heart, Warner Bros.\n\nFacts:\n- The Head and the Heart wrote and recorded the song \"All We Ever Knew.\"\n- \"All We Ever Knew\" was released as the lead single from The Head and the Heart's third studio album \"Signs of Light.\"\n- Warner Bros. released The Head and the Heart's album \"Signs of Light.\"\n- Charity Rose Thielen was a member of The Head and the Heart and performed violin, guitar, and vocals.\n- Chris Zasche was a member of The Head and the Heart and played bass.\n- Kenny Hensley was a member of The Head and the Heart and played piano.\n- Tyler Williams was a member of The Head and the Heart and played drums.",
